<description>&lt;p&gt;A Colombian soldier was killed in a drone attack attributed to the ELN, while the Colombian Air Force bombed a guerrilla camp, causing at least three deaths. ELN and FARC guerrillas are now operating armed drones, expanding their capabilities. A major earthquake in Colombia has killed more than 224 people and rescue operations continue. Russian forces struck a major deployment hub in Ukraine that was used by Colombian mercenaries. The United Nations urged De la Espriella to uphold the peace agreement, and a U.S. indictment has revived former FARC leader Timochenko's name in a Venezuelan case, while UCDP recorded 225 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMipwFBVV95cUxNTldyT0ZxZ2NMUThObG53NUN0RmVya3VCLTRfcGhvSXBzNTZDNE1VUHlraEhGdEdnY0NIOUFHUGpaSzZPYkpEVktFSlVHZmFxRVNvQ1l1ZW9tVWdwdkhrS2dZalk2czJ4ZjZHTmltNUptWGZNVFZjT2VxQ2htem9mdFJQNlZCTWNXS1lqMk04blNGMjNUdF9OWWZucmx6WkN2T3k0RGNkVQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;Small Wars Journal&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMivgFBVV95cUxPNkdYQ216V1hmX2tCanVkNHdfTFBuSFdwUmN5UG9oM2daNXlUWVptbDRSM0VnVmcxcFhMWGJMbE9fYjkzRWZLbFVQV0ctcXJKazJ1bm9CeW5KMWYxWjBVNXE0MkVOMFRCS2V0ZGdPdEpTMjNpc1B5dEs5Tmwtbk1yLWw2V3RCSEFmWl80NnduaDJjc1VEalBxRThEbnU4cDRqYjJ4bHUtTDVfdWt1bEUxejFZc1hjQ2FpX29nRTJ30gG-AUFVX3lxTE82R1hDbXpXWGZfa0JqdWQ0d19MUG5IV3BSY3lQb2gzZ1o1eVRZWm1sNFIzRWdWZzFwWExYYkxsT19iOTNFZktsVVBXRy1xckprMnVub0J5bkoxZjFaMFU1cTQyRU4wVEJLZXRkZ090SlMyM2lzUHl0SzlObC1uTXItbDZXdEJIQWZaXzQ2d25oMmNzVURqUHFFOERudThwNGpiMnhsdS1MNV91a3VsRTF6MVlzWGNDYWlfb2dFMnc?oc=5&quot;&gt;Demócrata&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Demócrata&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMilwFBVV95cUxPa2NLU0dReFBSWVA5Zkoydm1DWlREYWJDUVRfWVl5ejVaSGJ4ZjViR1ZXbTVwX3ZBbUh3MHE3VjNZczVfY0